encies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.beta [e06dd8106e4c9113f2a3b20e4ceef16f3e85735e]\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (e06dd8106) - Fedora Linux 43 (Forty Three) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (RADV GFX1201) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 60.39 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you've copied the value of the \"Script\" property and still have it in your clipboard when you close the editor, the editor crashes with the following call stack:\n\n```\nOS::is_stdout_verbose() const (core/os/os.cpp:190)\nis_print_verbose_enabled() (core/string/print_string.cpp:367)\nGDScript::~GDScript() (modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp:1514)\nvoid memdelete<RefCounted>(RefCounted*) (core/os/memory.h:165)\nVariant::ObjData::unref() (core/variant/variant.cpp:1123)\nVariant::_clear_internal() (core/variant/variant.cpp:1418)\nVariant::~Variant() (core/variant/variant.h:875)\nEditorInspector::PropertyClipboard::~PropertyClipboard() (editor/inspector/editor_inspector.h:737)\n__run_exit_handlers (__run_exit_handlers:124)\nexit (0x00007FFFF7A29ABE:8)\n__libc_start_call_main (__libc_start_call_main:27)\n__libc_start_main@@GLIBC_2.34 (__libc_start_main@@GLIBC_2.34:42)\n_start (_start:13)\n```\n\n... because `OS::get_singleton()` has long since been destroyed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the main scene in the MRP\n2. Select the root scene node\n3. Right-click the \"Script\" property in the inspector\n4. Select \"Copy Value\"\n5. Close the editor\n6. Note the crash\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[script-clipboard-crash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27236007/script-clipboard-crash.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}